          "The <b>statement of financial position</b> shows a company's financial position <b>at a specific date</b>. In annual reports that date is <b>the last day of the company's fiscal year</b>. While many companies have a fiscal year end corresponding with the calendar year end (December 31), <b>this is not always the case</b>.",
