          "All Statements of Comprehensive Income <b>show the revenue generated for the period and then reduce that amount by charging off expenses</b> of one kind or another. Sales are reduced by the expenses incurred to generate the goods sold — the <b>Cost of Sales</b> — which include the <b>cost of inventories used to produce the goods as well as the labour</b> that went into production.",
