            ["<b>Risk analysis ratios</b>", "How well the company can <b>deal with its debt obligations</b>", "The <b>debt/equity ratio</b>, showing the relationship between the company's <b>borrowing and the capital invested in it by shareholders</b>"],
            ["<b>Operating performance ratios</b>", "How well <b>management is making use of the company's resources</b> — these ratios include <b>profitability and efficiency measures</b>", "<b>Return on common equity</b>, correlating the company's <b>profit with the money shareholders have invested</b>"],
            ["<b>Value ratios</b>", "What the company's <b>shares are worth, or the return on owning them</b>", "The <b>price-earnings ratio</b>, linking the <b>market price of a common share to earnings per common share</b>, allowing investors to rate the shares of companies <b>within the same industry</b>"]
